## Purpose

{{ v(m ~ ".description") }}, from {{ v(m ~ ".base") }}. The question it answers is whether the method
improves a small open model at writing DuckDB SQL for the questions of this repository, under one GPU
hour ceiling, as the twins confirm and not only as the reward pays. It is a portfolio demonstration
and not a model for use.

## Data

